sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Method version
  participant C as Context Relationship Graph
  participant E as Experiment records
  participant D as Independent evaluator
  participant B as MOSAIC Brain
  participant G as Existing governance

  M->>B: Immutable identity and scope
  B->>C: Resolve metadata references (read-only)
  C-->>B: Verified refs, freshness and coverage
  B->>E: Resolve canonical run references
  E-->>B: Run evidence references
  B->>D: Request independent review against frozen criteria
  D-->>B: Verdict and evidence refs
  B->>B: Validate identity and evaluate conditions
  B-->>G: Recommendation with reasons and evidence
  G->>G: Apply proposal lifecycle and dual gates
  G-->>M: Scope-bounded outcome or HOLD
